# turma (the craft) is public; a project's audience/offer/numbers are not.
clients/*
!clients/README.md
# defensive: a filled config or raw learnings log anywhere in the tree stays local
**/brand.local.md
**/learnings.local.md
**/growth/brand.md
**/growth/learnings.md

# python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
